<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Install CA Certificate</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        a.btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #2563eb; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.1em; }
        ol { line-height: 1.8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Internal CA</h1>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/root.crt">Download Certificate</a></p>
    <h3>After downloading:</h3>
    <ol>
        <li><b>Android:</b> Settings &rarr; Security &rarr; Encryption &rarr; Install a certificate &rarr; CA certificate</li>
        <li><b>iOS:</b> Open in Safari, install profile, then Settings &rarr; General &rarr; About &rarr; Certificate Trust Settings &rarr; enable</li>
        <li><b>Linux:</b> <code>sudo cp root.crt /usr/local/share/ca-certificates/caddy.crt && sudo update-ca-certificates</code></li>
        <li><b>macOS:</b> <code>sudo security add-trusted-cert -d -r trustRoot -k /Library/Keychains/System.keychain root.crt</code></li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>
